msgstr "Perintah Knock"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only the current channel owner (~) can transfer ownership"
msgstr "Hanya pemilik saluran saat ini (~) dapat mentransfer kepemilikan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only the founder can drop channel registration."
msgstr "Hanya pendiri yang bisa menjatuhkan registrasi saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Channel Central and select Registration to see whether the channel is registered, who founded it, and when it was registered. The same tab provides Register Channel and Drop Registration controls when your permissions allow them."
msgstr ""
"Buka Saluran Pusat dan pilih Registrasi untuk melihat apakah saluran "
"terdaftar, yang mendirikannya, dan ketika didaftarkan. Tab yang sama "
"menyediakan Saluran Register dan Pendaftaran Drop kontrol ketika izin Anda "
"mengizinkan mereka."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv.html.heex:99
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Channel Central and select the Registration tab to see registration status, register an unregistered channel, drop a channel as founder, and manage SOP, AOP, and VOP access lists."
msgstr ""
"Buka Kanal Pusat dan pilih tab registrasi untuk melihat status pendaftaran, "
"mendaftarkan saluran yang tidak terdaftar, drop saluran sebagai pendiri, dan"
" mengelola SOP, AOP, dan daftar akses VOP."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Channel Central for the channel, stay on the General tab, edit the Welcome Message field, then choose Save Welcome. Use Clear Welcome to remove it."
msgstr ""
"Buka Saluran Pusat untuk saluran, tetap pada tab Umum, edit ruas Pesan "
"Selamat Datang, lalu pilih Simpan Selamat Datang. Gunakan Clear Welcome "
"untuk menghapusnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_ui.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opening the Tab"
msgstr "Membuka Tab"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also set the join throttle from Channel Central's General tab. Enter 0 seconds to remove the throttle."
msgstr ""
"Operator juga dapat mengatur throttle gabungan dari tab Umum Channel "
"Central. Masukkan 0 detik untuk menghapus throttle."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Owners can open Channel Central's General tab, choose Transfer Ownership, enter the target nickname, and confirm the transfer."
msgstr ""
"Pemilik dapat membuka tab Umum Channel Central, memilih Pemilik Transfer, "
"masukkan nama panggilan target, dan konfirmasi transfer."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_ui.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Register Channel runs the same action as /cs register."
msgstr "Saluran Register menjalankan aksi yang sama seperti /cs register."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_access.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Registration Tab"
msgstr "Tab Pendaftaran"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Requires channel operator (@) or owner (~) status"
msgstr "Membutuhkan operator saluran (@) atau pemilik (~) status"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:35
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Aturan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_access.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "SOP users can manage AOP and VOP lists."
msgstr "Pengguna SOP dapat mengelola daftar AOP dan VOP."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_ui.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "SOP, AOP, and VOP sub-tabs show the same lists as /cs <level> list."
msgstr ""
"SOP, AOP, dan VOP sub- tab menunjukkan daftar yang sama sebagai daftar /cs "
"<level>."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_permissions.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Set welcome messages and join throttles in Channel Central"
msgstr "Set selamat datang pesan dan bergabung throttle di Channel Central"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Registration tab only enables Register Channel for channel operators."
msgstr ""
"Tab Pendaftaran hanya memungkinkan Saluran Register untuk operator saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_ui.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The dialog disables or hides write controls when you are not identified with NickServ or your ChanServ role cannot manage the selected list."
msgstr ""
"Dialog mematikan atau menyembunyikan kontrol penulisan ketika Anda tidak "
"diidentifikasi dengan NickServ atau peran ChanServ Anda tidak dapat "
"mengelola daftar yang dipilih."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The target nickname must be present in the channel"
msgstr "Nama panggilan target harus hadir dalam kanal"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This cannot be undone without the new owner's cooperation"
msgstr "Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan tanpa kerjasama pemilik baru"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_permissions.html.heex:210
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Transfer Ownership"
msgstr "Kepemilikan Transfer"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_permissions.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Transfer ownership to another channel member"
msgstr "Transfer kepemilikan ke anggota saluran lain"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use the commands while the channel is the active conversation."
msgstr "Gunakan perintah sementara kanal adalah percakapan aktif."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When invite-only is set, users cannot join unless they are invited by an operator. In Channel List, invite-only rows show a +i badge; non-members see Request Access... instead of Join and can send a knock request with an optional message."
msgstr ""
"Ketika invite- hanya diset, pengguna tidak dapat bergabung kecuali mereka "
"diundang oleh operator. Dalam Daftar Saluran, baris-saja invite- hanya "
"menampilkan lencana + i; bukan anggota lihat Akses Permintaan... alih-alih "
"Gabung dan dapat mengirim permintaan ketukan dengan pesan opsional."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_register.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You must be identified with NickServ before ChanServ accepts changes."
msgstr ""
"Anda harus diidentifikasi dengan NickServ sebelum ChanServ menerima "
"perubahan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "button in the toolbar. Invite-only (+i) channels are marked with a +i badge; select one and choose Request Access... to send a knock request to its operators."
msgstr ""
"tombol di toolbar. Hanya undangan (+ i) saluran ditandai dengan lencana + i;"
" pilih satu dan pilih Akses Permintaan... untuk mengirim permintaan ketukan "
"ke operatornya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_ui.html.heex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Channel Central for a channel you have joined, then choose Registration after Access Lists. The status area shows whether the channel is registered and who the founder is."
msgstr ""
"Buka Saluran Pusat untuk saluran yang telah Anda bergabung, kemudian pilih "
"Registrasi setelah Akses Lists. Area status menunjukkan apakah saluran "
"terdaftar dan siapa pendirinya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv.html.heex:110
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{window} of inactivity"
msgstr "%{window} tidak aktif"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/chanserv_access.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Registration tab shows SOP, AOP, and VOP lists as selectable sub-tabs. Users with enough access choose Add to type a nickname into the list, and remove an entry with the button on its row."
msgstr "Tab Pendaftaran menampilkan daftar SOP, AOP, dan VOP sebagai sub-tab yang bisa dipilih. Pengguna dengan akses cukup memilih Tambah untuk mengetik nama panggilan ke daftar, dan menghapus entri dengan tombol di barisnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:65
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A channel can refuse you because of a ban, a key, a user limit, invite-only mode or registered-only mode."
msgstr "Sebuah saluran dapat menolak Anda karena larangan, kunci, batas pengguna, invite- hanya mode atau mode registered- saja."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A channel name starts with # and has no spaces. It can be up to 50 characters long."
msgstr "Sebuah nama saluran dimulai dengan # dan tidak memiliki ruang. Bisa sampai 50 karakter panjang."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A guest, or a person using a registered nickname without identifying, is refused with a message that the channel needs a registered nickname."
msgstr "Seorang tamu, atau seseorang menggunakan nama panggilan terdaftar tanpa identifikasi, ditolak dengan pesan bahwa saluran membutuhkan julukan terdaftar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A knock is a short request to join, sent to the operators of an invite-only channel. Turn knocks off when the channel is closed to new members, or when knock requests become noise or spam. Operators can still invite people directly."
msgstr "Sebuah ketukan adalah permintaan singkat untuk bergabung, dikirim ke operator dari satu-satunya saluran undangan. Matikan ketukan ketika saluran ditutup untuk anggota baru, atau ketika permintaan ketukan menjadi kebisingan atau spam. Operator masih bisa mengundang orang secara langsung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A knock is shown only to operators and owners who are in the channel. You can knock on the same channel once per minute."
msgstr "Sebuah ketukan hanya ditunjukkan kepada operator dan pemilik yang berada di saluran. Anda dapat mengetuk pada saluran yang sama sekali per menit."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A new channel starts without the lock. In a registered channel the lock and the topic are saved and come back after a restart."
msgstr "Saluran baru dimulai tanpa kunci. Dalam saluran terdaftar kunci dan topik disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A new channel starts without this mode. In a registered channel the mode is saved and comes back after a restart."
msgstr "Saluran baru dimulai tanpa mode ini. Dalam saluran yang terdaftar Modus disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A new message replaces the old one. Members who are looking at the channel when a new message is set get a short notice."
msgstr "Sebuah pesan baru menggantikan yang lama. Anggota yang sedang melihat kanal ketika pesan baru diset mendapatkan pemberitahuan singkat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A person who joins sees the message as a line that starts with Welcome, visible only to them."
msgstr "Seseorang yang bergabung melihat pesan sebagai baris yang dimulai dengan Selamat Datang, hanya terlihat kepada mereka."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A person who joins without the key, or with the wrong key, is refused with a bad key error."
msgstr "Seseorang yang bergabung tanpa kunci, atau dengan kunci yang salah, ditolak dengan kesalahan kunci yang buruk."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A regular member who tries to speak gets an error that says they need voice."
msgstr "Seorang anggota biasa yang mencoba untuk berbicara mendapat kesalahan yang mengatakan mereka membutuhkan suara."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A secret channel cannot have a public archive. A published archive stops being public when the channel becomes secret."
msgstr "Saluran rahasia tidak boleh memiliki arsip publik. Sebuah arsip yang diterbitkan berhenti menjadi publik ketika saluran menjadi rahasia."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Add a second owner when you run a channel together with someone, so both of you have full control. A channel can have more than one owner at the same time. To hand the channel over and step down yourself, use a transfer instead."
msgstr "Tambahkan pemilik kedua ketika Anda menjalankan saluran bersama-sama dengan seseorang, sehingga Anda berdua memiliki kontrol penuh. Sebuah saluran dapat memiliki lebih dari satu pemilik pada saat yang sama. Untuk menyerahkan saluran dan turun sendiri, menggunakan transfer sebagai gantinya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Allow 3 joins per minute"
msgstr "Ijinkan 3 bergabung per menit"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Allow 5 joins per 10 seconds"
msgstr "Ijinkan 5 bergabung per 10 detik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Allow 5 joins per 30 seconds"
msgstr "Ijinkan 5 bergabung setiap 30 detik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation adds the nickname to the channel's invite exceptions. That nickname can then join for as long as the exception exists. An operator can remove it at any time."
msgstr "An invitation adds the nickname to the channel's invite exceptions. That nickname can then join for as long as the exception exists. An operator can remove it at any time."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation does not get around the limit. Bots in the channel count as members."
msgstr "Sebuah undangan tidak mendapatkan sekitar batas. Bots dalam saluran menghitung sebagai anggota."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation does not replace a key or get around a user limit."
msgstr "Undangan tidak menggantikan kunci atau melewati batas pengguna."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation does not replace the key. An invited person still needs it to join."
msgstr "Undangan tidak menggantikan kunci. Orang yang diundang masih membutuhkannya untuk bergabung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An unregistered channel closes when the last person leaves, and its topic and modes are lost. Register it with ChanServ to keep it, its settings and its access list."
msgstr "Sebuah saluran tidak terdaftar tertutup ketika orang terakhir meninggalkan, dan topik dan mode yang hilang. Daftarkan dengan ChanServ untuk menyimpannya, pengaturan dan daftar aksesnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Anyone else who tries to join is refused with a message that the channel is invite-only."
msgstr "Orang lain yang mencoba untuk bergabung ditolak dengan pesan bahwa saluran adalah invite- saja."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ask the operators to let you in"
msgstr "Meminta operator untuk membiarkan Anda masuk"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Both numbers must be whole numbers greater than zero. If the value is not valid, the throttle does not change."
msgstr "Kedua angka harus seluruh angka lebih besar dari nol. Jika nilainya tidak valid, throttle tidak berubah."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Bots are never throttled, but their joins are counted."
msgstr "Bot tidak pernah berdenyut, tapi mereka bergabung dihitung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Change the topic when the topic is locked."
msgstr "Ubah topik ketika topik terkunci."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Channel Central and the slow command always allow 5 joins in the number of seconds you choose. Use the mode command to pick a different count."
msgstr "Channel Central and the slow command always allow 5 joins in the number of seconds you choose. Use the mode command to pick a different count."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable color stripping"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan penanggalan warna"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable invite only"
msgstr "Matikan hanya undangan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable moderated mode"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan mode termoderasi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable no external messages"
msgstr "Matikan tidak ada pesan eksternal"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable no-knock mode"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan mode no- knock"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable registered-only mode"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan mode hanya-registerd"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disable topic lock"
msgstr "Matikan kunci topik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each member holds one rank at a time. Half-operator sits above voice and below operator."
msgstr "Setiap anggota memegang satu peringkat pada satu waktu. Setengah operator duduk di atas suara dan di bawah operator."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each member holds one rank at a time. Half-operators and above can kick, and operators and above can ban. Both only work on members of a lower rank."
msgstr "Setiap anggota memegang satu peringkat pada satu waktu. Setengah operator dan di atas dapat menendang, dan operator dan di atas dapat melarang. Keduanya hanya bekerja pada anggota pangkat lebih rendah."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each member holds one rank at a time. Operator status given with this command is not kept when the person leaves."
msgstr "Setiap anggota memegang satu peringkat pada satu waktu. Status Operator yang diberikan dengan perintah ini tidak disimpan ketika orang pergi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each member holds one rank at a time. Voice sits above regular members and below half-operators."
msgstr "Setiap anggota memegang satu peringkat pada satu waktu. Suara duduk di atas anggota reguler dan di bawah half- operator."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:47
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each person sees it once per session. Leaving and joining again in the same session does not show it again."
msgstr "Setiap orang melihatnya sekali dalam sesi. Meninggalkan dan bergabung lagi dalam sesi yang sama tidak menunjukkan lagi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable color stripping"
msgstr "Aktifkan penanggalan warna"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable invite only"
msgstr "Aktifkan hanya undangan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable moderated mode"
msgstr "Aktifkan mode termoderasi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable no external messages"
msgstr "Aktifkan tidak ada pesan eksternal"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable no-knock mode"
msgstr "Aktifkan mode no- knock"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable registered-only mode"
msgstr "Aktifkan mode registered- saja"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Enable topic lock"
msgstr "Aktifkan kunci topik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:49
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Even with knocks allowed, each person can knock on the same channel only once per minute."
msgstr "Bahkan dengan mengetuk diperbolehkan, setiap orang dapat mengetuk pada saluran yang sama hanya sekali per menit."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Even without this mode, a person must be in the channel to send messages to it. Someone who is not a member is always refused."
msgstr "Bahkan tanpa mode ini, seseorang harus berada di saluran untuk mengirim pesan kepadanya. Seseorang yang bukan anggota selalu ditolak."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everyone in a channel sees the same conversation. A channel usually has a theme, a topic shown at the top, and a few people who look after it."
msgstr "Semua orang di saluran melihat percakapan yang sama. Sebuah saluran biasanya memiliki tema, topik yang ditampilkan di bagian atas, dan beberapa orang yang merawatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Give operator to Alice"
msgstr "Berikan operator ke Alice"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:15
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Give voice to Alice"
msgstr "Berikan suara kepada Alice"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Give voice to a user"
msgstr "Berikan suara kepada pengguna"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Give voice to the guests of a talk, the people asking questions, or trusted regulars. In a moderated channel they can speak while everyone else listens. Voice gives no other power. A voiced user cannot kick, ban or change modes."
msgstr "Berikan suara kepada tamu dari pembicaraan, orang-orang bertanya, atau pelanggan tetap terpercaya. Dalam saluran modern mereka dapat berbicara sementara orang lain mendengarkan. Suara tidak memberikan kekuatan lain. Seorang pengguna voced tidak dapat menendang, ban atau mengganti mode."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Half-operator is a helper rank. Give it to people who should keep a conversation in order but should not control the channel itself. They can remove a troublemaker and manage who speaks, while the settings stay with operators and owners."
msgstr "Setengah operator adalah peringkat pembantu. Berikan kepada orang-orang yang harus menjaga percakapan dalam rangka tetapi tidak harus mengontrol saluran itu sendiri. Mereka dapat menghapus pengacau dan mengelola siapa yang berbicara, sementara pengaturan tetap dengan operator dan pemilik."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Half-operators can speak in a moderated channel without voice."
msgstr "Half- operator dapat berbicara dalam saluran modern tanpa suara."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Half-operators cannot set or clear the welcome message."
msgstr "Half- operator tidak dapat menset atau menghapus pesan selamat datang."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Half-operators, operators and owners can give voice to members who should speak."
msgstr "Half- operator, operator dan pemilik dapat memberikan suara kepada anggota yang harus berbicara."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_welcome_message.html.heex:38
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:19
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:27
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:21
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:25
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Bagaimana cara kerjanya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "If the channel does not exist yet, joining creates it. The first person in a new channel becomes its owner and can set its modes."
msgstr "Jika saluran tidak ada belum, bergabung menciptakannya. Orang pertama dalam saluran baru menjadi pemiliknya dan dapat mengatur mode."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "If the person is not in the channel, the transfer fails and nothing changes."
msgstr "Jika orang tidak dalam saluran, transfer gagal dan tidak ada perubahan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel the key is saved and comes back after a restart."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar kunci disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel the limit is saved and comes back after a restart."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar batas disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel the mode and the invite exceptions are saved and come back after a restart."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar mode dan pengecualian mengundang disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:56
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:65
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:55
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:68
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:51
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel the mode is saved and comes back after a restart."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar Modus disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel the throttle is saved and comes back after a restart."
msgstr "Dalam saluran terdaftar throttle disimpan dan kembali setelah restart."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel, a transfer does not change the ChanServ founder or access list. Ranks given on joining still come from that list."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar, transfer tidak mengubah pendiri ChanServ atau daftar akses. Ranks diberikan pada bergabung masih datang dari daftar itu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_v.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel, add people to the ChanServ voice list to give them voice each time they join."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar, tambahkan orang ke dalam daftar suara ChanServ untuk memberi mereka suara setiap kali mereka bergabung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel, people on the ChanServ operator list become operators each time they join."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar, orang-orang pada daftar operator ChanServ menjadi operator setiap kali mereka bergabung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel, people on the ChanServ voice list receive voice when they join."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar, orang-orang dalam daftar suara ChanServ menerima suara ketika mereka bergabung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a registered channel, the founder and the people on the ChanServ %{level} list become owners each time they join."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang terdaftar, pendiri dan orang-orang pada ChanServ %{level} daftar menjadi pemilik setiap kali mereka bergabung."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In an unregistered channel, the owner rank goes to whoever joins the empty channel first. Register the channel with ChanServ to keep it."
msgstr "Dalam saluran yang tidak terdaftar, peringkat pemilik pergi ke siapa pun bergabung saluran kosong pertama. Daftar saluran dengan ChanServ untuk menyimpannya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In the Channel List, people who are not in the channel see a placeholder row with the number of users. The name and the topic are not shown."
msgstr "Dalam Daftar Saluran, orang-orang yang tidak berada di saluran melihat baris placeholder dengan jumlah pengguna. Nama dan topik tidak ditampilkan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Invite Alice to the current channel"
msgstr "Undang Alice ke kanal saat ini"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Invite people to an invite-only channel and see knock requests."
msgstr "Undang orang ke undangan - hanya saluran dan lihat permintaan ketukan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Join Throttle (+j)"
msgstr "Gabung Throttle (+j)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Join a channel that has a key"
msgstr "Gabung kanal yang memiliki kunci"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Join with key"
msgstr "Gabung dengan kunci"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Kick and ban members of lower rank: half-operators, voiced users and regular members."
msgstr "Kick and ban members of lower rank: half-operators, voiced users and regular members."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Knocking only works on invite-only channels. Without invite-only mode, this mode has no visible effect."
msgstr "Mengetuk hanya bekerja pada invite- hanya saluran. Tanpa mode invite- saja, mode ini tidak memiliki efek yang terlihat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Limits how many users can join the channel within a time window. Format is count:seconds. For example, %{example} allows 5 joins per 10 seconds."
msgstr "Batas berapa banyak pengguna yang dapat bergabung dengan saluran dalam jendela waktu. Format adalah jumlah: detik. Misalnya, %{example} mengijinkan 5 bergabung per 10 detik."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lowering the limit never removes anyone. People already inside stay in the channel."
msgstr "Menurunkan batas tidak pernah menghapus siapa pun. Orang-orang sudah di dalam tinggal di saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make Alice a half-operator"
msgstr "Membuat Alice operator half-"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:27
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make Alice an owner"
msgstr "Membuat Alice pemilik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:26
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make Alice the owner and become an operator"
msgstr "Membuat Alice pemilik dan menjadi operator"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make channel private"
msgstr "Buat kanal privat"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make channel secret"
msgstr "Membuat rahasia saluran"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make trusted people operators so the channel is looked after when you are away. Operators keep order, welcome newcomers and handle trouble. Give the rank only to people you trust, because operators can also make other operators."
msgstr "Membuat operator terpercaya sehingga saluran dijaga ketika Anda pergi. Operator menjaga ketertiban, menyambut pendatang baru dan menangani masalah. Berikan peringkat hanya untuk orang yang Anda percaya, karena operator juga dapat membuat operator lain."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Members are not affected. To limit what members can say, use moderated mode instead."
msgstr "Anggota tidak terpengaruh. Untuk membatasi apa yang dapat dikatakan anggota, lebih baik gunakan moda moderasi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Members keep reading everything, and they can still join and leave."
msgstr "Anggota tetap membaca semuanya, dan mereka masih bisa bergabung dan pergi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Members of the channel see the real name and topic as usual."
msgstr "Anggota saluran melihat nama asli dan topik seperti biasa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Messages sent before the mode was set keep their formatting. The channel topic is not changed."
msgstr "Pesan yang dikirim sebelum mode ditata tetap format mereka. Topik saluran tidak berubah."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Messages written in Markdown are also turned into plain text."
msgstr "Pesan yang ditulis dalam Markdown juga diubah menjadi teks biasa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove the key."
msgstr "Hanya operator saluran dan pemilik yang dapat menset atau menghapus kunci."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove the limit."
msgstr "Hanya operator saluran dan pemilik yang dapat mengatur atau menghapus limit."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_j.html.heex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove the throttle."
msgstr "Hanya operator saluran dan pemilik yang dapat mengatur atau menghapus throttle."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:53
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:56
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:62
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:47
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_nk.html.heex:40
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:53
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_r.html.heex:47
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove this mode."
msgstr "Hanya operator saluran dan pemilik yang dapat menset atau menghapus mode ini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only channel operators and owners can turn the lock on or off."
msgstr "Hanya operator saluran dan pemilik dapat mengaktifkan atau mematikan kunci."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_h.html.heex:47
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only operators and owners can give or remove half-operator status. The person must be in the channel."
msgstr "Hanya operator dan pemilik yang dapat memberikan atau menghapus status operator-campuran. Orang itu pasti ada di saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only operators and owners can give or remove operator status. The person must be in the channel."
msgstr "Hanya operator dan pemilik yang dapat memberikan atau menghapus status operator. Orang itu pasti ada di saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators and owners can invite people. Half-operators cannot. The invited person must be online and not already in the channel."
msgstr "Operator dan pemilik dapat mengundang orang. Setengah operator tidak bisa. Orang yang diundang harus online dan belum ada di saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Invite Only and choose Apply Modes."
msgstr "Operator juga dapat membuka Kanal Pusat, menuju tab Modes, centang Hanya Undang dan pilih Opsi Terapkan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Key, type the key and choose Apply Modes."
msgstr "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Key, type the key and choose Apply Modes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_l.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Limit, type the number and choose Apply Modes."
msgstr "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Limit, type the number and choose Apply Modes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_m.html.heex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Moderated and choose Apply Modes."
msgstr "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Moderated and choose Apply Modes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:47
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Topic Lock and choose Apply Modes."
msgstr "Operators can also open Channel Central, go to the Modes tab, tick Topic Lock and choose Apply Modes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_o.html.heex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators cannot give or remove owner status. Only owners can do that."
msgstr "Operator tidak dapat memberikan atau menghapus status pemilik. Hanya pemilik yang bisa melakukan itu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_q.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Owner status given with this command is not kept when the person leaves the channel."
msgstr "Status pemilik yang diberikan dengan perintah ini tidak disimpan ketika orang meninggalkan saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_i.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "People already in the channel are not removed."
msgstr "Orang-orang sudah di saluran tidak dihapus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_k.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "People already in the channel stay there when you set or change the key."
msgstr "Orang-orang sudah di saluran tinggal di sana ketika Anda mengatur atau mengubah kunci."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_c.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "People can still type formatting. The server removes it before anyone sees the message."
msgstr "Orang masih bisa mengetik format. Server menghapusnya sebelum ada yang melihat pesan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Private mode does not hide the channel from whois or the hover card. Use secret mode if the name must not appear there."
msgstr "Mode pribadi tidak menyembunyikan saluran dari whois atau kartu hover. Gunakan mode rahasia jika nama tidak boleh muncul di sana."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Private mode does not stop anyone from joining. A person who types the name can still enter."
msgstr "Modus pribadi tidak menghentikan siapa pun untuk bergabung. Orang yang mengetik nama masih bisa masuk."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_s.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Public Archive"
msgstr "Arsip Publik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channel_transfer_ownership.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ranks last while people stay in the channel. In an unregistered channel, if you leave after the transfer while others are still inside, you come back as a regular member."
msgstr "Ranks terakhir sementara orang tinggal di saluran. Dalam saluran tidak terdaftar, jika Anda meninggalkan setelah transfer sementara yang lain masih di dalam, Anda kembali sebagai anggota biasa."

